sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Dev as Developer / CI
  participant CLI
  participant G as Orchestrator graph
  participant P as Planner
  participant R as TestRunner
  participant S as BrowserSession
  participant E as Executor
  participant J as Judge
  participant Rep as Reporter

  Dev->>CLI: aie2e run URL --goal ...
  CLI->>G: invoke(target)
  G->>G: crawl (capped BFS, same-origin, skips logout/delete)
  G->>P: plan(target, siteMap)
  P-->>G: TestCase[] (goal + expectations)

  loop each test (up to N in parallel)
    G->>R: run(test)
    R->>S: open() fresh Chromium + collectors
    R->>E: execute(test, session)
    E-->>R: ExecutionOutcome (mode, steps, heals, agentClaim)
    Note over E,R: The agent's claim is recorded but never trusted
    R->>J: judge(test, session, outcome)
    J->>S: collect evidence (URL, aria tree, console, network, screenshot)
    J-->>R: Verdict + Evidence
    R->>S: close()
    R-->>G: TestResult
  end

  G->>Rep: report(RunReport)
  Rep-->>Dev: report.json + report.html + console summary
  CLI-->>Dev: exit code 0 pass, 1 fail, 2 error
